###Block: Descriptions
Alter Fortune.MOD	DESC:Target must reroll any die roll it just made taking the second roll.
Animalistic Power.MOD	DESC:Subject is imbued with +2 to Strength, Dexterity and Constitution.
Animalistic Power (Mass).MOD	DESC:Subject is imbued with +2 to Strength, Dexterity and Constitution.
As the Frost.MOD	DESC:Immunity to Cold; DR:10/magic and piercing; inflict 2d6 cold damage to all within 15 ft. each round [failed fort save and creature is slowed]; Gain Outsider Type.
Baleful Blink.MOD	DESC:Creature has 50%% miss chance on any attack. No miss chance to hit affected creature.
Disrupting Hand.MOD	DESC:Target of the spell is forced to make a concentration check with a DC equal to the spell's save DC any time they cast a spell.
Helpful Hand.MOD	DESC:Magic hand holds object [max 20 lbs] for you, grants +2 compentance bonus on Craft, Disable Device and Open Lock checks. Taking an item from the hand or giving it an item is a swift action.
Striking Fist.MOD	DESC:Hand attacks with attack bonus of your caster level plus your key ability + 2 [hands strength], hand deals 1d6 per two levels [max 5d6].
Tripping Hand.MOD	DESC:Hand does trip maneuver [no AoO] attack bonus equals caster level + key ability modifier + 2, +1 for every three levels [max +5 at 15th].
Warding Hand.MOD	DESC:Hand hinders creature of Large or smaller, see text.
Blade of Blood.MOD	DESC:Weapon deals an additional 1d6 damage, if you take 5 pts of damage the weapon deals a total of 3d6 extra damage.
Black Karma Curse.MOD	DESC:If the target fails it's save, it immediately takes damage as if struck by it's currently held weapon or most damaging natural attack.
Blade Brothers.MOD	DESC:Once during the spell, if a subject attempts a saving throw, both recipients can roll and use the most favorable result. If both saves fail, both are affected by the spell.
Bleakness.MOD	DESC:Living creatures take 1d6 points of damage each round. Any effect that prevents negative damage prevents the damage [death ward]. Undead gain turn +4 turn resistance and fast healing 3 while in the area of effect. Also dispels any light spell of equal or lower level.
Blessing of the Righteous.MOD	DESC:You and your allies melee and ranged attacks deal an extra 1d6 holy damage, weapons are considered good-aligned for overcoming DR.
Blinding Color Surge.MOD	DESC:Target must save or be blinded, you also gain invisibility.
Blood Creeper.MOD	DESC:Subject takes 1 point of piercing damage per caster level [max 15] each round. The target is held securely in place. Subject can make a strength check DC 20, or Escape Artist DC 25.
Bones of the Earth.MOD	DESC:Creates pillar each round. See text.
Bright Worms.MOD	DESC:Deals fire damage to enemies in area, 2d6 [3d6 @11th, 4d6 @ 15th].
Burning Rage.MOD	DESC:Subject gains +1 bonus on attack rolls, +2 bonus to damage, DR:2/magic. Subject take 4 points of fire damage each round though.
Call of Stone.MOD	DESC:Target must make successive saves each round or slowly turn into stone statue.
Celerity.MOD	DESC:Can immediately take a standard action as if you had readied an action. You are dazed until the end of your next turn.
Celerity (Greater).MOD	DESC:Can immediately take a full action or [standard and move action] as if you had readied an action. You are dazed until the end of your next turn.
Celerity (Lesser).MOD	DESC:Can immediately take a move action. You are dazed until the end of your next turn.
Chain Dispel.MOD	DESC:Each creature is affected as if by a targeted dispel magic [max caster level added to check +25].
Channeled Divine Health.MOD	DESC:Ranged healing; See text.
Channeled Divine Shield.MOD	DESC:Gain DR based upon casting time; See text.
Channeled Pyroburst.MOD	DESC:Deal damage to opponent(s) based upon casting time; See text.
Chasing Perfection.MOD	DESC:Subject improves in all ways, +4 enhancement bonus to all ability scores.
Cloud of Knives.MOD	DESC:Each round as a free action you can release a knife at any opponent you can see within 30 ft. Attack bonus = Caster level + Key Ability. Damage 1d6 +1/3 level [max +5] Crit 19-20.
Condemnation.MOD	DESC:Stun target outsider for one round and reduce spell resistance by 10.
Crown of Clarity.MOD	DESC:+2 competence bonus to Listen and Spot checks or if subject discharges spell gain +8 on a single Spot or Listen check.
Crown of Grave.MOD	DESC:Wearer can compel undead with a one-word command once per minute. See text.
Crown of Might.MOD	DESC:+2 Strength enhancement or discharge for +8 Strength for one round.
Crown of Protection.MOD	DESC:+1 deflection bonus to AC and +1 resistance bonus on all saves.
Crown of Smiting.MOD	DESC:Choose alignment (chaotic, evil, good or lawful). Once per minute, gain +2 divine bonus on damage rolls no next melee or ranged attack if the opponent has the designated alignment or Discharge for a +8 bonus.
Crown of Veils.MOD	DESC:+2 competence bonus to Disguise and Hide checks or discharge for +8.
Crushing Grip.MOD	DESC:1st effect [no save, SR yes] target has -2 on attacks, checks, saves and AC and 20 ft. penalty to speed. 2nd effect [spell completion] Fort save or be paralyzed.
Curse of Arrow Attraction.MOD	DESC:Subjects AC against any ranged attack is -5, including projectile weapons, thrown weapons, and ranged attacks. In addition, any critical threats are automatically confirmed.
Deflect.MOD	DESC:Gain shield bonus to AC against one attack. Bonus is equal to +1 per two caster levels.
Deflect (Lesser).MOD	DESC:Gain deflection bonus to AC against one attack. Bonus is equal to +1 per three caster levels [max +5].
Dimension Shuffle.MOD	DESC:Teleport any subject creature to any other spot within 30 ft. [See restrictions in text].
Dimension Step.MOD	DESC:Allies can make a short teleport. They can teleport line of sight up to their base speed.
Dispelling Touch.MOD	DESC:Dispel an ongoing spell that has been cast upon a creature or object, or a spell that has a noticeable ongoing effect. [max +10 on d20 check]; see text.
Divine Retaliation.MOD	DESC:Create divine weapon that mimics deity's favored weapon. Attack modifier is caster level + Str or Wis modifier (your choice). Damage is the same as base weapon + 1-1/2 Str or Wis modifier (your choice). The weapon strikes for like amount against any creature that attacks you.
Doom Scarabs.MOD	DESC:Deal 1d6/2 caster levels [max 10d6] plus any creature with Spell Resistance whom you overcome you gain 1d4 temp HP.
Dragonshape.MOD	DESC:You take on the form and abilities of a mature adult red dragon. You gain 150 temp HP. You do not gain the normal spellcasting ability of the new form.
Drifts of the Shalm.MOD	DESC:Delay enemies with a drift [double movement penalty] of snow, leaves or ash (your choice); snow casues 3 cold damage; leaf can be ignited and cause 2d6 damage; ash causes 3 fire damage.
Electric Vengeance.MOD	DESC:You can only cast this spell after a creature has done hit point damage to you with a melee attack. Deals 2d8 +1/level [Max +10] electricity damage.
Electric Vengeance (Greater).MOD	DESC:You can only cast this spell after a creature has done hit point damage to you with a melee attack. Deals 5d8 +1/level [Max +15] electricity damage. Target must make Fortitude save or be dazed until the end of your next turn.
Energy Aegis.MOD	DESC:Gain resistance 20 against one energy type for one attack.
Energy Surge.MOD	DESC:Imbue weapon with elemental energy of one specific type. Weapon deals 2d6 of specified energy type.
Energy Surge (Greater).MOD	DESC:Imbue weapon with elemental energy of one specific type. Weapon deals 3d6 of specified energy type.
Energy Surge (Lesser).MOD	DESC:Imbue weapon with elemental energy of one specific type. Weapon deals 1d6 of specified energy type.
Energy Vulnerability.MOD	DESC:You can affect a number of creatures with total hit dice equal to twice your caster level. You select which creatures are affected. Choose an energy type and that creature takes an additional 50%% damage from that type.
Etherealness (Swift).MOD	DESC:Subject becomes ethereal until the end of it's next turn.
Evard's Menacing Tentacles.MOD	DESC:You create two tentacles with a 10-foot reach. As a free action direct each one to attack an opponent in range using your base attack bonus and Str Modifier. Bludgeoning Damage dealt is 1d8 +Str Modifier. Also gain +4 bonus on Climb checks
Explosive Rune Field.MOD	DESC:Any creature that begins it's turn in the rune field must make a Reflex save or take 4d6 fire damage. Creatures moving through the area must save or take damage. Moving at half speed through the area counts as if the creature had made it's Reflex save.
Field of Resistance.MOD	DESC:All creatures in the area gain Spell Resistance of 11 + caster level; see text.
Friend to Foe.MOD	DESC:Your enemies see each other as loathesome and vile causing them to turn on each other. They will each attack until damage is inflicted once and then the spell ends for that particular subject.
Halt.MOD	DESC:The creatures feet become stuck to the ground.
Healing Spirit.MOD	DESC:Create a spirit that heals with positive energy 1d8 [undead are dealt damage] Flies at 30 ft.; see text.
Hesitate.MOD	DESC:Creature can only take move action on it's turn; retry save each round [swift action].
Hunter's Eye.MOD	DESC:Gain sneak attack ability. Deal 1d6/3 caster levels.
Incite Riot.MOD	DESC:Affected creatures attack the nearest creature on its next turn.
Increase Virulence.MOD	DESC:The DC for all saving throws against the poison increase by 2.
Inevitable Defeat.MOD	DESC:You draw a cloud over the subject's mind, dealing 3d6 points of nonlethal damage. No saving throw is allowed against this effect. Each round on its turn, the subject must succeed on a Will save or take another 3d6 points of nonlethal damage. If the saving throw is successful, the damage for that round is negated and the spell ends.
Insight of Good Fortune.MOD	DESC:Reroll once after making an attack, skill check, saving throw or ability check before result is known and take the better result.
Invest Heavy Protection.MOD	DESC:Living creature healed 5d4 +1 per two caster levels [max +12] and gains DR:5/evil for 1 minute. On failed save undead take an extra 5 points of damage from a weapon that overcomes DR/good.
Invest Light Protection.MOD	DESC:Living creature healed 1d4 +1 per two caster levels [max +3] and gains DR:1/evil for 1 minute. On failed save undead take an extra 1 points of damage from a weapon that overcomes DR/good.
Invest Moderate Protection.MOD	DESC:Living creature healed 3d4 +1 per two caster levels [max +6] and gains DR:1/evil for 1 minute, undead damaged by likewise amount. On failed save undead take an extra 3 points of damage from a weapon that overcomes DR/good.
Kelgore's Fire Bolt.MOD	DESC:This spell conjures a small orb of rock and sheathes it in arcane energy. This spell deals 1d6 points of fire damage per caster level (maximum 5d6). If you fail to overcome the target's spell resistance, the spell still deals 1d6 points of fire damage from the heat and force of the conjured orb's impact. Material Component: A handful of ashes.
Kelgore's Grave Mist.MOD	DESC:Living creatures become fatigued and take 1d6 cold damage per round. If you fail to overcome SR you still do damage.
Legion of Sentinels.MOD	DESC:Ghostly swordfighters appear. They can occupy any space even those with another creature or object. They can flank and threaten AoO. Each has HP equal to twice your caster level and AC 25. See text.
Linked Perception.MOD	DESC:All allies get a shared awareness. +2 bonus on Spot and Listen checks per ally in the area [example: you and three allies would make +6].
Longstrider (Mass).MOD	DESC:All allies in the area gain a +10-foot enhancement bonus to their speed.
Luminous Assassin (Lesser).MOD	DESC:Assassin falls on target attacking; see text.
Luminous Assassin (Greater).MOD	DESC:Assassin falls on target attacking; see text.
Luminous Assassin.MOD	DESC:Assassin falls on target attacking; see text.
Magic Convalescence.MOD	DESC:Whenever a creature, including you casts a spell cast within the area of this spell, you heal 1 hit point per level of the spell cast.
Mana Flux.MOD	DESC:20%% spell failure for any creature trying to cast a spell, use a spell-like ability, activate a supernatural ability or manifest a psionic power, as do spell completion items such scrolls.
Mark of Doom.MOD	DESC:Subject marked takes 1d6 damage any time it continues fighting; see text.
Mark of Judgement.MOD	DESC:Whenever a creature succeeds on a melee or ranged attack agsinst the marked creature, that attacker heals 2 points of damage.
Melf's Unicorn Arrow.MOD	DESC:Ranged touch attack deals 1d8+8 damage, plus target is subject to a bull rush; conjure one arrow per three caster levels after 5th [max 5 at 17th].
Meteoric Strike.MOD	DESC:Your next successful melee attack deal 1d6 + 1d6/4 caster levels fire damage; all adjacent creatures take half the damage [SR applies and Reflex for half of that].
Mirror Image (Greater).MOD	DESC:As mirror image, except an additional image is created each round after the first, up to a max of eight concurrent images.
Mystic Aegis.MOD	DESC:You cast mystic aegis immediately when you are targeted by a hostile spell. You gain Spell Resistance 12 + your caster level.
Mystic Surge.MOD	DESC:The subject's next spell save DC is +2 and effective caster level is +1.
Overwhelm.MOD	DESC:With a touch, you deal nonlethal damage to the subject equal to the creature's current hit point total.
Phantom Battle.MOD	DESC:All who fail their save cannot make attacks of opportunity. In addition all creatures are considered flanked. You can choose a number of allies that the spell does not affect equal to your caster level.
Plague.MOD	DESC:The subject contracts a disease selected from the table -pg.121.
Prismatic Mist.MOD	DESC:Any creature in the area are affected by one or more effects -see table pg.122.
Pulse of Hate.MOD	DESC:Deal 2d6 unholy damage each round on your turn to all in the area.
Radiance.MOD	DESC:Undead are dazzled by illumination for the duration they are in the area and 1d6 rounds after they leave. Illuminate as daylight spell.
Ray of the Python.MOD	DESC:Creature struck can only make one attack a round, cannot make attacks of opportunity and has their speed reduced by 10 feet [save allowed each round to avoid the effect for that round].
Regroup.MOD	DESC:Each subject of this spell appears adjacent to you (or as close to you) in an unoccupied square.
Renewed Vigor.MOD	DESC:Remove the fatigued condition from all creatures in area, and exhausted creatures become fatigued. +2 bonus to Constitution for 1 round per caster level.
Righteous Burst.MOD	DESC:Heals all allies 1d8 +1/caster level [max +35], each enemy take a likewise same damage. [Will save for half]
Rouse.MOD	DESC:Sleeping creatures wake up.
Scattering Trap.MOD	DESC:Designated squares teleport any creature moving through them to a random direction [1d6 squares - see PHB 158].
Seeking Ray.MOD	DESC:Ranged touch attack [no penalty for firing into melee], ignores concealment and cover, deals 4d6 electricity. See text.
Share Talents.MOD	DESC:Creatures get a +2 bonus on any skill checks they make as long as one has at least 1 rank in the skill.
Slashing Dispel.MOD	DESC:Functions as dispel magic [phb 223]. Any creature affect by the dispel take 2 points of damage per level of the spell removed, it takes multiple damage if multiple spells removed.
Sonic Shield.MOD	DESC:Grants a +4 deflection AC bonus. In addition, any creature hitting you takes 1d8 sonic damage and must make a Fortitude save or be knocked back 5 ft; see text.
Stand.MOD	DESC:Subject immediately stands, without provoking attacks of opportunity.
Stay the Hand.MOD	DESC:Target refrains from attacking you or targetting you with spells for the remainder of the current round.
Stifle Spell.MOD	DESC:You cast this spell to distract another creature. Target must make a concentration check DC 14 + your key ability + the level of the spell being cast.
Stretch Weapon.MOD	DESC:Adds 5 feet of reach for one attack.
Summon Golem.MOD	DESC:Summon a flesh, clay, stone or iron golem. Golem acts on your next turn.
Sure Strike.MOD	DESC:Gain a +1/3 caster levels insight bonus to hit.
Thunder Field.MOD	DESC:Any creature that starts its turn in the area must save [Fortitude] or take 1d8 sonic damage. Affected creatures must save [Reflex] or be knocked prone.
Toxic Weapon.MOD	DESC:Next attack delivers poison; poison deals 1d10 Constitution damage and another 1d10 Con damage after 1 minute [must save for each instance].
Trollshape.MOD	DESC:You take on the form and abilities of a troll (MM 247), gain 30 temp HP.
Vertigo.MOD	DESC:DC 10 Balance check each round to take a move action, if it fails it cannot move, fails by 5 or more falls prone. -2 penalty on attack rolls and saving throws; see text.
Vertigo Field.MOD	DESC:Area counts as difficult terrain, attacks have a 20%% miss chance. Creature starting in the field must make Fortitude save or become nauseated 1 round. Exclude allies up to your caster level against the nauseated effect.
Visions of the Future.MOD	DESC:Gain +2 sacred bonus on all saving throws and +2 dodge bonus to Armor Class; discharging spell grants bigger bonus for a round.
Whelm.MOD	DESC:Deal 1d6 nonlethal damage plus 1d6 for every two caster levels beyond 1st [max 5d6 @ 9th].
Whelm (Mass).MOD	DESC:Deal 1d6/level [max 10d6] nonlethal damage.
Whelming Blast.MOD	DESC:Deal 1d6 nonlethal damage for every two caster levels [max 5d6 @ 10th].
Wrack Earth.MOD	DESC:Deals 1d6 bludgeoning/caster level [max 15d6] to every creature in line. Rubble made and creatures must make Reflex or be moved to a random side. Rubble counts as difficult terrain [double movement].

###Block: Other modifications
