Enlarge Person.MOD	SUBSCHOOL:Polymorph
Gaseous Form.MOD	SUBSCHOOL:Polymorph
Liveoak.MOD	SUBSCHOOL:Polymorph
Polymorph Any Object.MOD	SUBSCHOOL:Polymorph
Polymorph.MOD	SUBSCHOOL:Polymorph
Reduce Animal.MOD	SUBSCHOOL:Polymorph
Reduce Person (Mass).MOD	SUBSCHOOL:Polymorph
Reduce Person.MOD	SUBSCHOOL:Polymorph
Shapechange.MOD	SUBSCHOOL:Polymorph
Transformation.MOD	SUBSCHOOL:Polymorph
Tree Shape.MOD	SUBSCHOOL:Polymorph
